# Per-host TLS wiring, hand-placed on servers that have certificates. Untracked
# on purpose: the deploy's `git reset --hard` only touches tracked files, so an
# untracked override survives every push — same reasoning as .env. The template
# it is copied from IS committed.
docker-compose.override.yml

# Runtime log dirs the logger creates from an absolute Windows path when
# NODE_ENV/log paths are misconfigured — never meant to be committed.
Backend/**/D:\\*
.audit.json